<title>FRANCE: Eurotunnel rare riser in Paris.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel rare riser in Paris.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA/Plc were among the few stocks to show gains on the CAC index on Wednesday, with the stock up 2.16 percent at 7.10 francs at 1004 GMT. The overall market was 1.48 percent weaker.</p>
<p>Brokers said news the first Eurostar train was going through the Channel tunnel today since a fire two weeks ago was positive.</p>
<p>The shares had risen yesterday on hopes the Inter-Governmental Commission handling tunnel safety would allow the resumption of passenger traffic imminently.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
